<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Pending Approvals · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>body{margin:0;padding:20px;background:#fff4e8;color:#220b4a;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1400px;margin:auto}button,input,select{font:inherit;padding:12px;border:1px solid #d9c8ec;border-radius:10px}button{background:#35116c;color:white;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5}article,section.card{background:white;border:1px solid #dfd2eb;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;margin:16px 0}.warning{background:#fff0ed;color:#9c202b;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}.count{background:#ba1831;color:white;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:24px;display:inline-block}.row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{text-align:left;padding:12px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}td input{max-width:140px}.changed{background:#fff4dc}.muted{color:#6e6082}summary{cursor:pointer;padding:10px}a{color:#35116c}dialog{border:0;border-radius:14px;max-width:90vw}button.secondary{background:#eee3f7;color:#35116c}.table-wrap{overflow:auto}#message:empty{display:none}.totals{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:14px 0}.total-tile{background:#f3ecfb;border:1px solid #dfd2eb;border-radius:12px;padding:14px}.total-tile small,.total-tile strong{display:block}.total-tile strong{font-size:26px;margin-top:6px}.totals>p{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0;font-size:14px}.suggestion-note{color:#752f04;font-weight:700}.suggested{outline:2px solid #e8b253;outline-offset:-2px}.suggested input{border-color:#c98a20}
.route-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;background:#fff;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e8dff0}.route-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:23px}.route-progress{flex:1 1 300px;max-width:620px;padding:14px 18px;border:2px solid #cf9300;border-radius:12px;background:#ffe45c;color:#332300;box-shadow:0 3px 10px #35116c18;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.route-progress[hidden]{display:none}.route-progress strong,.route-progress small{display:block}.route-progress strong{font-size:18px}.route-progress small{margin-top:5px;font-size:14px}.route-progress.success{background:#d5f8a0;border-color:#438517;color:#234708}.route-progress.error{background:#ffe0e5;border-color:#bf183b;color:#8f1230}.route-progress.working strong::before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;margin-right:9px;border:3px solid #71530050;border-top-color:#493600;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:-3px;animation:approval-spin .8s linear infinite}@keyframes approval-spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.route-progress.working strong::before{animation:none}}@media(max-width:650px){body{padding:10px}article,section.card{padding:12px;margin:10px 0}h2{font-size:21px}.table-wrap{overflow:visible}table,tr,td{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}th{display:none}tr:has(th){display:none}tr{padding:12px;border:1px solid #dfd2eb;border-radius:12px;margin:12px 0;background:#fff}tr.changed{background:#fff4dc}td{border:0;padding:6px 0}td:not(:first-child)::before{content:attr(data-label);display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}td input{width:100%;max-width:none;box-sizing:border-box}td button{width:100%;margin-top:8px}.totals{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.totals .total-tile:last-of-type{grid-column:1/-1}.total-tile{padding:10px}.total-tile strong{font-size:23px}}
</style></head><body><main><a href="/workspaces">← Workspaces</a><h1>Pending Approvals</h1><p>Review delivery corrections, instruction suggestions, product requests and driver-reported problems. Clean verified deliveries are approved automatically.</p><div class="row"><strong id="count" class="count">Loading approvals…</strong><button id="refresh">Refresh</button><label>Find route, customer or invoice <input id="search" type="search"></label><label><input id="all" type="checkbox"> Include approved</label></div><details><summary>What makes up this count?</summary><div id="breakdown"></div></details><p id="message" role="status"></p><div id="queue"></div></main><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/office-approvals.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/office-notification.js"></script></body></html>
